WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
Go away, you're afraid of your mother

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:05,000
After all, you were only eighteen years old when you were pregnant with Rainbow Dash.

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:06,000
You two are brave enough

4
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:08,030
That sister of yours is too much

5
00:00:08,030 --> 00:00:10,030
When she finds out that Rainbow Dash is her biological daughter,

6
00:00:10,030 --> 00:00:11,030
Look how she has a face

7
00:00:11,030 --> 00:00:13,990
Rainbow Dash will never have contact with her again

8
00:00:13,990 --> 00:00:17,730
I won't let her near my child again

9
00:00:17,730 --> 00:00:20,240
Yunqi, I have something to do in the afternoon.

10
00:00:20,240 --> 00:00:21,240
Can't take care of the baby

11
00:00:21,240 --> 00:00:22,240
are you free this afternoon

12
00:00:22,240 --> 00:00:24,100
Didn't come to pick up the baby right away

13
00:00:24,100 --> 00:00:25,100
Thank you for your hard work, Yunqi

14
00:00:25,100 --> 00:00:27,100
Bring another set of clothes for the baby

15
00:00:27,100 --> 00:00:28,100
I got a little dirty when I ate just now.

16
00:00:34,220 --> 00:00:35,220
Baby, uncle changed your clothes

17
00:00:35,220 --> 00:00:36,220
I'll take you to play

18
00:00:36,220 --> 00:00:46,910
Baby, my four-pack abs are going to be flattened by you.

19
00:00:46,910 --> 00:00:49,390
The baby hasn’t been to grandpa’s company yet, right?

20
00:00:49,390 --> 00:00:51,390
Let's go see how grandpa works

21
00:00:51,390 --> 00:00:52,390
good or not

22
00:00:52,390 --> 00:00:53,390
See if grandpa has eaten?

23
00:00:53,390 --> 00:00:55,390
Dad is at work today too
